      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053336
    m_Localized: Exalted Drosithia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053337
    m_Localized: Drosithias are timid and helpful by nature, but their situation
      forced them into a more shy approach. For an unknown reason, Dragon Guardians
      hunt Drosithias, pushing the species to the very edge of extinction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053339
    m_Localized: Can't be <style="Blue">revived</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053340
    m_Localized: '-'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053343
    m_Localized: 'Activation: Drosithia deals 5 <style="Blue">damage</style> to <style="Blue">random</style>
      enemy'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053338
    m_Localized: Drosithia deals {Effect0.ValueInt} <style="Blue">damage</style>
      to a <style="Blue">random</style> enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053249
    m_Localized: "Malicious disposition, mean eyes, nasty tricks up their sleeves
      \u2013 Pinequeaks have a well-earned bad reputation. They have different names
      in each city, as other vermin have. The two most frequent variants are Pulpins
      and Firples."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053252
    m_Localized: 'When Pinequeak is <smallcaps><style="Blue">hurt</style></smallcaps>:
      Add two unupgraded <style="Blue">{Effect0.ValueString}</style> cards to your
      hand'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053253
    m_Localized: 'When Pinequeak is <smallcaps><style="Blue">hurt</style></smallcaps>:
      Add <style="Blue">{Effect0.ValueString}</style> card to your hand'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053255
    m_Localized: 'When Pinequeak is <smallcaps><style="Blue">hurt</style></smallcaps>:
      Add two unupgraded <style="Blue">{Effect0.ValueString}</style> cards to your
      hand'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053256
    m_Localized: Increase <style="Blue">Health</style> by {Mystling.Health}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053260
    m_Localized: Icelings are predominantly reclusive creatures, but some of them
      cultivate curiosity that springs in their hearts. Individuals who leave the
      snowy mountaintops are one of the bravest and most outgoing creatures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053263
    m_Localized: 'Iceling gains additional <style="Blue">Power</style> equal to the
      <style="Blue">number of cards</style> in your hand.

      Start of Battle:
      <style="Blue">Draw</style> {Effect0.ValueInt} cards'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053264
    m_Localized: 'Iceling gains additional <style="Blue">Power</style> equal to the
      <style="Blue">number of cards</style> in your hand.

      Round End: Double
      <style="Blue">Strength</style> of front Mystling'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053266
    m_Localized: 'Start of Battle: <style="Blue">Draw</style> {Effect0.ValueInt}
      cards'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053267
    m_Localized: 'Round End: Double <smallcaps><style="Blue">Strength</style></smallcaps>
      of front Mystling'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053271
    m_Localized: Golomos keep to their tight communities, avoiding contact with humans
      or other creatures. Threatened Golomos can go on a rampage, attacking everything
      in sight and causing small-scale earthquakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053274
    m_Localized: Golomo <smallcaps><style="Blue">Revives</style></smallcaps> twice
      per Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053275
    m_Localized: 'Golomo <smallcaps><style="Blue">Revives</style></smallcaps> once
      per Battle

      Start of Battle: Golomo gains {Effect1.ValueInt} permanent
      <smallcaps><style="Blue">Multistrike</style></smallcaps>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053277
    m_Localized: Golomo <smallcaps><style="Blue">Revives</style></smallcaps> twice
      per Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053278
    m_Localized: 'Start of Battle: Golomo gains {Effect1.ValueInt} permanent <smallcaps><style="Blue">Multistrike</style></smallcaps>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053282
    m_Localized: Glarexes are stoic and lofty, ignoring the outside world, as they
      don't need to feed. If anything disrupts their meditative peace, they will
      try to quickly destroy such an obstacle. Glarexes can somehow turn light into
      a solid substance, making it their greatest weapon and armor at the same time.
      It is also said that a Glarexus may appear before a dead person to guide their
      soul into a new body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053285
    m_Localized: Glarexus keeps full <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>
      at the end of Round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053286
    m_Localized: 'Glarexus loses {Effect1.ValueInt} <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>
      at the end of Round, instead of all

      Round End: Glarexus deals <style="Blue">damage</style>
      equal to {Effect2.AdditionalValueString}% of its <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>
      value'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053288
