      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053293
    m_Localized: Small and silent, Prowlers stalk forests, hunt tiny animals, and
      gather berries and nuts. Their cozy nests are well hidden in tree hollows,
      where they sleep during the daytime. Tamers have received many requests to
      domesticate a Prowler. Most of them refused because of ethical reasons, but
      some tried. And all failed miserably as the Prowlers are too proud and dangerous
      to get along with human families.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053294
