    m_Localized: Exalted Bolb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053348
    m_Localized: Bolbs cherish boredom and laziness and make use of those traits
      by mastering the art of camouflage and traps. You may encounter Bolbs outside
      the bogs of overgrown lakes, but such events are rare. Those creatures leave
      their habitat only if they go hungry for at least two weeks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053349
    m_Localized: Bolb <style="Blue">Heals</style> {Effect0.ValueInt} of its Health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053350
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Return</style> {Effect1.AdditionalValueString}% of
      incoming <style="Blue">damage</style> to attackers. Bolb can't receive <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>
