    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053355
    m_Localized: 'Activation: Bolb <style="Blue">Heals</style> {Effect2.ValueInt}
      of its Health'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053356
    m_Localized: Return {Effect1.ValueInt}% of incoming <style="Blue">damage</style>
      to attackers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053324
    m_Localized: Frogmar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053325
    m_Localized: Exalted Frogmar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053326
    m_Localized: Energetic and temperamental, Frogmars are known for their vengeful
      nature. Cross a Frogmar, and it won't rest until you've learned the meaning
      of pain. Frogmars like humans and other mystlings, but they are often shunned
      because others are afraid of their anger outbursts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053327
    m_Localized: Frogmar gains {Effect0.ValueInt} <smallcaps><style="Blue">Strength</style></smallcaps>
      and loses {Effect1.ValueInt} <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053328
    m_Localized: Frogmar doubles <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>
      gained
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053329
    m_Localized: 'Frogmar doubles <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>
      gained.

      Frogmar''s first attack in Battle deals triple <style="Blue">damage</style>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053330
    m_Localized: Frogmar triples <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>
      gained
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053331
    m_Localized: Frogmar doublse <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>
      gained
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053332
    m_Localized: 'Change Talent: Frogmar''s first attack in Battle deals triple <style="Blue">damage</style>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053333
    m_Localized: Frogmar triples <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>
      gained
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053334
    m_Localized: '<smallcaps><style="Blue">Activate</style></smallcaps>: Frogmar
      gains {Effect1.ValueInt} <smallcaps><style="Blue">Strength</style></smallcaps>
      and loses {Effect2.ValueInt} <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053313
    m_Localized: Fale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053314
    m_Localized: Exalted Fale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053315
    m_Localized: Fales are friendly and adorable. They like to splash in shallow
      waters, stroll on beaches on their short legs, and dive together with other
      creatures. Despite their look, Fales can be trained to fight. They can be fierce
      protectors and helpers - and they do love competition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053316
    m_Localized: Fale <smallcaps><style="Blue">Activates</style></smallcaps> all
      other Mystlings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053317
    m_Localized: Fale <smallcaps><style="Blue">Revives</style></smallcaps> first
      <style="Blue">fainted</style> Mystling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053318
    m_Localized: Fale <smallcaps><style="Blue">Revives</style></smallcaps> first
      two other Mystlings to <style="Blue">faint</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053319
    m_Localized: 'Fale <smallcaps><style="Blue">Revives</style></smallcaps> first
      <style="Blue">fainted</style> Mystling.

      Fale gains {Effect0.ValueInt}
      <smallcaps><style="Blue">Strength</style></smallcaps> when other Mystlings
      <smallcaps><style="Blue">activate</style></smallcaps>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053320
    m_Localized: 'Fale <smallcaps><style="Blue">Revives</style></smallcaps> first
      <style="Blue">fainted</style> Mystling.

      When any other Mystling <style="Blue">faints</style>,
      <smallcaps><style="Blue">Stun</style></smallcaps> all enemies'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053321
    m_Localized: Fale <smallcaps><style="Blue">Revives</style></smallcaps> first
      two other Mystlings to <style="Blue">faint</style>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053322
    m_Localized: Fale gains {Effect0.ValueInt} <smallcaps><style="Blue">Strength</style></smallcaps>
      when other Mystlings <smallcaps><style="Blue">activate</style></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053323
    m_Localized: When any other Mystling <style="Blue">faints</style>, <smallcaps><style="Blue">Stun</style></smallcaps>
      all enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053302
    m_Localized: Eftus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053303
    m_Localized: Exalted Eftus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053304
    m_Localized: 'Eftuses don''t mind others as long as they allow them to do their
      incomprehensible activities. They ignore other mystlings, they ignore tamers,
      and only react if something physically harms them. It is said that a band of
      Eftuses captured a pirate ship once and they have been sailing choppy waters
      since then. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053305
    m_Localized: Eftus deals {Effect0.ValueInt} <style="Blue">damage</style> to the
      <style="Blue">last</style> enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053306
    m_Localized: '<style="Blue">Knock Out</style>: Gain {Effect0.ValueInt} Mystberry'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053307
    m_Localized: '<style="Blue">Knock Out</style>: Gain {Effect0.ValueInt} Mystberry,
      Eftus permanently gains {Effect1.ValueInt} <style="Blue">Health</style>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053308
    m_Localized: '<style="Blue">Knock Out</style>: Gain {Effect0.ValueInt} Mystberry,
      Eftus permanently gains {Effect1.ValueInt} <style="Blue">Power</style>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053309
    m_Localized: '<style="Blue">Knock Out</style>: Gain {Effect0.ValueInt} Mystberry
      and {Effect1.ValueInt} <style="Blue">Energy</style>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053310
    m_Localized: '<style="Blue">Knock Out</style>: Eftus permanently gains {Effect1.ValueInt}
      <style="Blue">Health</style>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053311
    m_Localized: '<style="Blue">Knock Out</style>: Eftus permanently gains {Effect1.ValueInt}
      <style="Blue">Power</style>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 5776446912053312
    m_Localized: '<style="Blue">Knock Out</style>: Gain {Effect1.ValueInt} <style="Blue">Energy</style>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 31100841666019328
    m_Localized: Fales are friendly and adorable. They like to splash in shallow
      waters, stroll on beaches on their short legs, and dive together with other
      creatures. Despite their look, Fales can be trained to fight!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 31100841678602240
    m_Localized: Small and silent, Prowlers stalk forests, hunt tiny animals, and
      gather berries and nuts. Their cozy nests are well hidden in tree hollows,
      where they sleep during the daytime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 31100841678602241
    m_Localized: Glarexes are stoic and lofty, ignoring the outside world, as they
      don't need to feed. If anything disrupts their meditative peace, they will
      try to quickly destroy such an obstacle!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 32555650210930688
    m_Localized: Dragon's Aura
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 32555650231902208
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Evolve</style> Drosithia into the dragon after {Effect0.Conditions.0}
      battles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139486171136
    m_Localized: Emberling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336960
    m_Localized: Exalted Emberling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336961
    m_Localized: Emberling deals {Effect0.ValueInt} <style="Blue">damage</style>
      to all Enemies and {Effect1.ValueInt} <style="Blue">damage</style> to other
      Mystlings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336962
    m_Localized: Emberling can freely choose his target when attacking with a card
      (doesn't apply to cards targeting Random or All enemies)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336963
    m_Localized: Emberling can freely choose his target when attacking with a card
      (doesn't apply to cards targeting Random or All enemies)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336964
    m_Localized: Emberling can freely choose his target when attacking with a card
      (doesn't apply to cards targeting Random or All enemies)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336965
    m_Localized: 'Emberling can freely choose his target when attacking with a card
      (doesn''t apply to cards targeting Random or All enemies).

      Attack: Enemy
      behind the target takes 50% damage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336966
    m_Localized: 'Activate: Emberling deals {Effect0.ValueInt} <style="Blue">damage</style>
      to all Enemies and {Effect0.ValueInt} <style="Blue">damage</style> to other
      Mystlings'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336967
    m_Localized: Increase Emberling's <style="Blue">Power</style> by {Mystling.Power}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336968
    m_Localized: 'Attack: Enemy behind target takes 50% <style="Blue">damage</style>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336969
    m_Localized: Luminesca
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336970
    m_Localized: Exalted Luminesca
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336971
    m_Localized: Luminesca applies {Effect0.ValueInt} <smallcaps><style="Blue">Strength</style></smallcaps>,
      {Effect1.ValueInt} <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps> and
      <style="Blue">Heals</style> {Effect2.ValueInt} Health to the front Mystling,
      then <smallcaps><style="Blue">Stuns</style></smallcaps> itself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336972
    m_Localized: Every 2nd <smallcaps><style="Blue">Hurt</style></smallcaps> Luminesca
      gains {Effect0.ValueInt} <smallcaps><style="Blue">Dodge</style></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336973
    m_Localized: Every 2nd <smallcaps><color=#40E0D0>Hurt</color=#40E0D0></smallcaps>
      Luminesca gains 1 <smallcaps><color=#40E0D0>Dodge</color=#40E0D0></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336974
    m_Localized: Every 2nd <smallcaps><color=#40E0D0>Hurt</color=#40E0D0></smallcaps>
      Luminesca gains 1 <smallcaps><color=#40E0D0>Dodge</color=#40E0D0></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336975
    m_Localized: Every 2nd <smallcaps><color=#40E0D0>Hurt</color=#40E0D0></smallcaps>
      Luminesca gains 1 <smallcaps><color=#40E0D0>Dodge</color=#40E0D0></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336976
    m_Localized: On <smallcaps><style="Blue">Activate</style></smallcaps> Luminesca
      applies extra {Effect1.ValueInt} <smallcaps><style="Blue">Strength</style></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336977
    m_Localized: On <smallcaps><style="Blue">Activate</style></smallcaps> Luminesca
      applies {Effect2.ValueInt} <smallcaps><style="Blue">Shields</style></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 45921139511336978
    m_Localized: On <smallcaps><style="Blue">Activate</style></smallcaps> Luminesca
      <style="Blue">Heals</style> {Effect3.ValueInt} <style="Blue">Health</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 55722999243939840
    m_Localized: Gaiadon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 55722999269105665
    m_Localized: 'Base form: Gaiadon gains {Effect0.ValueInt} <style="Blue">Dragon
      Charge</style>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 55722999269105666
    m_Localized: 'Upon gaining 5 <style="Blue">Dragon Charges</style>, Gaiadon transforms
      into Dragon Form until the end of Round.

      Dragon Form: Gain {Effect3.ValueInt}
      <style="Blue">Strength</style> and {Effect2.ValueInt} <style="Blue">Shields</style>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 56431011013140483
    m_Localized: Lear gains {Effect1.ValueInt} <style="Blue">Health</style> each
      time it <smallcaps><style="Blue">Activates</style></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 55722999269105673
    m_Localized: Lear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 55722999269105674
    m_Localized: Exalted Lear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 55722999269105675
    m_Localized: Lear gains {Effect0.ValueInt} <style="Blue">Health</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 55722999269105676
    m_Localized: 'When Lear is <smallcaps><style="Blue">Hurt</style></smallcaps>:
      Lear gains <smallcaps><style="Blue">Strength</style></smallcaps> equal to Health
      lost'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 55722999269105677
    m_Localized: 'When Lear is <smallcaps><color=#40E0D0>Hurt</color=#40E0D0></smallcaps>:
      Lear gains <smallcaps><color=#40E0D0>Strength</color=#40E0D0></smallcaps> equal
      to Health lost'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 55722999269105678
    m_Localized: 'Permanently reduce <style="Blue">damage</style> received by {Effect0.AdditionalValueString}%
      <br><smallcaps><style="Blue">Hurt</style></smallcaps>: Gain <smallcaps><style="Blue">Strength</style></smallcaps>
      equal to <style="Blue">Health</style> lost'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 55722999269105679
    m_Localized: 'Permanently increase <style="Blue">damage</style> received by {Effect1.AdditionalValueString}%
      <br><style="Blue">Hurt</style>: Gain <style="Blue">Strength</style> equal to
      twice the <style="Blue">Health</style> lost'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 56431011013140484
    m_Localized: Permanently <style="Blue">reduce damage</style> received by {Effect0.AdditionalValueString}%
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 56431011013140485
    m_Localized: Permanently <style="Blue">increase damage</style> received by {Effect1.AdditionalValueString}%,
      double <smallcaps><style="Blue">Strength</style></smallcaps> gain when <smallcaps><style="Blue">hurt</style></smallcaps>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 59051605030412288
    m_Localized: Pinequeak's Gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 59051605059772416
    m_Localized: 'Start of Battle: <color=#40E0D0>Draw</color=#40E0D0> 2 <color=#40E0D0>Blind
      Anger</color=#40E0D0> cards'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 59051605059772417
    m_Localized: Iceling's Gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 59051605059772418
    m_Localized: 'Every 2nd Round: <color=#40E0D0>Draw</color=#40E0D0> 1 card'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 59051605059772419
    m_Localized: Golomo's Gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 59051605059772420
    m_Localized: 'Start of Battle: Golomo applies 3 <smallcaps><color=#40E0D0>Vulnerable</color=#40E0D0></smallcaps>
      to front Enemy'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 63394363265777664
    m_Localized: These mountainous creatures lead a secluded life, but the most curious
      ones venture further and one might encounter them in the lower areas. Surprisingly,
      Icelings possess an exceptional vigor and love to train.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
  - m_Id: 63747457782644736
    m_Localized: Pinequeak's diminutive form conceals a spirit full of exuberance.
      Their temper, honed to razor sharpness, and their well-aimed fury can turn
      the tide of any battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654816
